    "description": "The FW500 Series comprises the FW500-C and FW500-E models, which are dual-interval, Class III, non-automatic weighing instruments. Self-indicating, mains or battery powered, and may be used for direct sales to the public. Plastic construction; front LCD (FW500-C) or LED (FW500-E) display with keypad; optional rear LCD (FW500-C) or LED (FW500-E) display; stainless steel load receptor; level indicator. Devices: initial zero setting device, semi-automatic zero setting device, zero tracking device, zero indicator, net indicator, stable weight indicator, semi-automatic subtractive tare balancing device, low battery indicator, hold function, gravity compensation, calibration/set-up mode via sealed internal switch. Interfaces: none. Software held in firmware with identification number V1.xx; access to legally relevant parameters prevented by a jumper on the main board; sealing by tamper-evident method."
